xi98TqsNi88Gl"},{"name":"Longsword","type":"melee","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["versatile-p"],"otherTags":[]},"damageRolls":{"ycSnm4QHt3LRvSen":{"damage":"1d8+6","damageType":"slashing","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":11},"attackEffects":{"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}}},"flags":{"pf2e":{"linkedWeapon":"jJc3ONr0m1JlG6n0"}},"_id":"4N5SXoeytmicdk1X","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688843103447,"modifiedTime":1688843330757,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Positive Healing","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Unlike other skeletons, living bones draw health from positive energy. Despite being spirits, they are living creatures, which means they're healed by positive healing effects, they aren't destroyed when reduced to 0 Hit Points, and they're damaged by negative damage and not healed by effects that would normally heal undead (like a champion's touch of corruption).</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"i4QKPZuxHrTY69hA","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688843183158,"modifiedTime":1688843226438,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Soothing Glow","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>20 feet. Living bones have a glow about them that radiates a positive attitude and soothes the mind of others with a wide, toothy smile. As long as the living bones takes no hostile actions, it exudes a peaceful aura. Creatures in the aura who attempt a hostile action must attempt a @Check[type:will|dc:17] save. A creature who succeeds on their saving throw is temporarily immune for 1 minute; otherwise, they don't take the action against the living bones and the action is wasted, but they can attempt the saving throw again by spending more actions. If the living bones takes a hostile action, the soothing glow deactivates for 1 minute, allowing others to attack them with ease.</p>"},"rules":[{"key":"Aura","radius":20,"traits":["divine","emotion","vitality"]}],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["aura","divine","emotion","vitality"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"w7hACaOQbNjwwnyW","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688843183447,"modifiedTime":1688843316677,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Reaction.webp","name":"Shield Block","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"